From 5d84dcbd55f5000d9900630dbcf9e03d2a73edda Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuya Hamamachi <yuya.hamamachi.sx@renesas.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:17:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] ipa: rppx1: Add tuning file for imx477

Add a tuning file for the Raspberry Pi High Quality Camera (imx477)
with the AGC, AWB and CCM parameters.

The values are converted from the Raspberry Pi VC4 tuning file
(src/ipa/rpi/vc4/data/imx477.json):

 - The AGC exposure modes and constraint modes are taken as they are.
   The metering modes are the standard ones used by the other tuning
   files.
 - The AWB modes, priors and transverse limits are taken as they are.
   As done for the imx708, the colourGains are the inverse of the
   whitepoint values of the ct_curve.
 - The CCM matrices are identical to the ones of the VC4 file.

These are not calibrated with an R-Car V4H (Sparrow Hawk) and an
imx477 module.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Yuya Hamamachi <yuya.hamamachi.sx@renesas.com>
---
 src/ipa/rppx1/data/imx477.yaml | 160 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/ipa/rppx1/data/meson.build |   1 +
 2 files changed, 161 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/ipa/rppx1/data/imx477.yaml

diff --git a/src/ipa/rppx1/data/imx477.yaml b/src/ipa/rppx1/data/imx477.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..cb2cbf9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/ipa/rppx1/data/imx477.yaml
